Possible solutions:

- Appropriate horizontal overflow.
- Subtle edge fades.
- Scroll the active item into view.
- Hide the scrollbar only if scrollability remains discoverable.

Use a browser-supported `scrollIntoView` approach and avoid unintentionally scrolling the entire page.

Do not rely on unsupported options without appropriate fallback behavior.

